body:
In fact, the parsing logic for wildcard domainsor header values follows the same pattern. 

Wildcard domain parsing reads from the `Host` header, while header parsing reads from the `OPEN-SANDBOX-INGRESS` header. Please refer to the specific codes below.

```go
targetHost := r.Header.Get(SandboxIngress)
if targetHost == "" {
	targetHost = r.Host
	if targetHost == "" {
		return nil, errors.New("missing header 'OPEN-SANDBOX-INGRESS' or 'Host'")
	}
}
```

In the above implementation, `OPEN-SANDBOX-INGRESS` is still the primary routing key, with domain name parsing serving as an additional method.

