**[P2] Inefficient re-parsing in DNS hot path.**

`UpstreamInExemptList` is called for every DNS query dial. Iterating through a slice of strings and calling `netip.ParseAddr` and `netip.ParsePrefix` every time is inefficient. 

```suggestion
	for _, s := range exemptList {
		// These should be pre-parsed and cached in ParseNameserverExemptList
		if a, err := netip.ParseAddr(s); err == nil && addr == a {
			return true
		}
		if p, err := netip.ParsePrefix(s); err == nil && p.Contains(addr) {
			return true
		}
	}
```

